OL,3,AStar Trek actor Walter Koenig, who
OL,4,Aplayed Pavel Chekov, dies aged 90
OL,5,
OL,6,FWalter Koenig, who played the spirited
OL,7,FRussian crewman Pavel Chekov in the
OL,8,Foriginal Star Trek TV series, has died
OL,9,Faged 90.
OL,11,FThe US actor was a mainstay on the show
OL,12,Ffrom season two in 1967 until it ended
OL,13,Fin 1969, later reprising his role as
OL,14,Fthe eager and earnest Chekov in the six
OL,15,Foriginal cast movies from 1979 through
OL,16,Fto 1991.
OL,18,FIn the mid-late 1990s, Koenig portrayed
OL,19,Fa very different character, the
OL,20,Fruthless Psi Corps telepath Alfred
OL,21,FBester, in another sci-fi space series,
OL,22,FBabylon 5.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
