OL,3,AStar Trek actor Walter Koenig, who
OL,4,Aplayed Pavel Chekov, dies aged 90
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis Star Trek co-star George Takei, who
OL,7,Fplayed Hikaru Sulu, led the tributes on
OL,8,Fsocial media on Monday, writing:
OL,9,F"Walter was more than Chekov. He was a
OL,10,Fwriter, a teacher, a thoughtful man,
OL,11,Fand a loyal friend."
